{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19293","headline":"和杨侍郎初至郴州纪事书情题郡斋八韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和杨侍郎初至郴州纪事书情题郡斋八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌节下朝台，分圭从北回。\n城头鹤立处，驿树凤栖来。\n旧路芳尘在，新恩馹骑催。\n里闾风偃草，鼓舞拚成雷。\n吏散山禽啭，庭香夏蕊开。\n郡斋堪四望，壁记有三台。\n人讶徵黄晚，文非吊屈哀。\n一吟梁甫曲，知是卧龙才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}